WEBVTT

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:30.063
The kids should learn it.

00:01:30.097 --> 00:01:31.997
I should teach it, they should learn it,

00:01:31.997 --> 00:01:33.097
Case closed."

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:36.163
Well, I said to her,

00:01:36.197 --> 00:01:39.263
"You know, kids don't learn
from people they don't like."

00:01:39.297 --> 00:01:41.597
(Laughter)

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:47.197
(Applause)

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:50.597
She said, "That's just a bunch of hooey."

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:51.630
And I said to her,

00:01:51.663 --> 00:01:56.063
"Well, your year is going to be
long and arduous, dear."

00:01:56.097 --> 00:01:57.563
Needless to say, it was.

